Error [jet.InvalidStatement]: Task-group parameter `max` is not supported
  --> tests/ui/task_group_parameter_label.jet:2:24
    |
  2 |     task.group workers(max: 2) {}
    |                        ^^^
 Why: A task group takes `limit:`, the most children running at once, and `stack:`, the least stack in bytes each child runs on
 Fix: Write `limit: n` or `stack: bytes`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
